/problem" "value" "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n$[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977620/example-4398.json" "file_sha256" "cc7256e31558297467f30d87742ed5f8906d00d0add65dd3b807e57a731c9d87"} {"question" "e-4398" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(-3)\\cdot 1+1\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\ 2\\cdot 1+0\\cdot (-2)+0\\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1)\\cdot 1+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3-2+0 \\\\ 2+0+0 \\\\ -1+4+0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977620/example-4398.json" "file_sha256" "cc7256e31558297467f30d87742ed5f8906d00d0add65dd3b807e57a731c9d87"} {"question" "e-4399" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if \n$[\\begin{aligned}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977620/example-4399.json" "file_sha256" "9aad25bd0e677fbbf09e0865d4f424ea09f232fb1220db14a84ad7e619afee57"} {"question" "e-4399" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =[\\begin{aligned}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot 3+c\\cdot 2 \\\\ b\\cdot 3+d\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3a+2c \\\\ 3b+2d\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13977620/example-4399.json" "file_sha256" "9aad25bd0e677fbbf09e0865d4f424ea09f232fb1220db14a84ad7e619afee57"}] "usage" {"q-127270" [] "e-4398" [] "q-13564" [] "e-4399" [] "e-4397" []} "basis" 812 "retractions" [[17592186101049 :question/problem "Find $Ax$ if\n\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$x = \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186101028 :question/problem "Find $By$ if\n\n$B = \\begin{bmatrix}a & -a & a \\\\ a & -2b & b \\\\ 2a & -b & a\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$y = \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$."] [17592186100601 :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100601 :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\cdot 2 + 3 \\cdot 5 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 7 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} &= \\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 7 \\cdot 2 + (-2) \\cdot 5\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$\\begin{bmatrix}17 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100602 :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if\n$\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100602 :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nAx &= \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}(-3) \\cdot 1 + 1 \\cdot (-2) + 1 \\cdot 0 \\\\ 2 \\cdot 1 + 0 \\cdot (-2) + 0 \\cdot 0 \\\\ (-1) \\cdot 1 + (-2) \\cdot (-2) + 5 \\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-3 - 2 + 0 \\\\ 2 + 0 + 0 \\\\ -1 + 4 + 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186100603 :question/problem "Find $A\\mathbf{x}$ if\n$\\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$"] [17592186100603 :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nAx &= \\begin{bmatrix}a & c \\\\ b & d\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}a \\cdot 3 + c \\cdot 2 \\\\ b \\cdot 3 + d \\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\\n&= \\begin{bmatrix}3a + 2c \\\\ 3b + 2d\\end{bmatrix}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186097939 17592186097940 17592186097941 17592186097942 17592186097943 17592186098065 17592186098066 17592186098067 17592186098068 17592186098069] "immutable_fields" [[17592186097938 :answer-field/correct] [17592186097938 :answer-field/id] [17592186097938 :answer-field/key] [17592186097938 :answer-field/type] [17592186098064 :answer-field/correct] [17592186098064 :answer-field/id] [17592186098064 :answer-field/key] [17592186098064 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
